  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICPD/UNFPA 2013 - ICPD UNFPA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICPD/UNFPA 2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom en FN-resolution har UNFPA f&#xe5;tt i uppdrag att g&#xf6;ra en &#xf6;versyn   av Kairoprogrammet (ICPD) inf&#xf6;r 2014 d&#xe5; programmet funnits i 20 &#xe5;r.   &#xd6;versynen syftar till att utcv&#xe4;rdera vad som har uppn&#xe5;tts under dessa &#xe5;r samt vilka utmaningar som &#xe5;terst&#xe5;r och kommer att presenteras vid  Generalf&#xf6;rsamlingens m&#xf6;te i septmebre 2014.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through a UN resolution, UNFPA was given the mandate to conduct an    overview of the ICPD programme of action which, in 2014, has been in  place for 20 years. The overview will loo at achievements and         remaining challenges and be presented at the UN Assembly in September 2014.</narrative>
  </description>
